## Why This Is Asked
The question probes practical privacy controls across a CNPA stack under load, requiring a coherent end-to-end approach and testing.

## Key Concepts
- Data redaction policy per field
- Middleware and data-transform pipelines
- Logs and analytics sanitization
- Feature flags and audits
- Peak-load verification and data lineage

## Code Example
